  <!-- The PRODUCT sources, except main.cpp. main.cpp owns wmain and this
       project has its own entry point in TestMain.cpp, so linking both would be
       a duplicate-symbol error. There is nothing in main.cpp worth unit
       testing: its only testable expression was the uiharness argv scan,
       which moved out with the harness. Everything else in it is process
       lifecycle, which only a real process can exercise - and that is what
       the CLI test suite does, driving wintcp.exe as a black box.

       This list must stay in step with the product project. It is written out
       rather than globbed because MSBuild has no reliable glob for ClCompile
       that survives a designer round-trip - but if a source is added to the
       product project and missed here, this project fails to LINK with
       unresolved externals, which is loud and immediate rather than silent. -->
